+        </a>
+       </h6>
+       <div class="paragraph">
+        <p>
+         After an interruption, run the helper without options to check what remains.
+Keep the journal unchanged and follow the printed next steps rather than
+starting a manual rotation.
+        </p>
+       </div>
+       <div class="paragraph">
+        <p>
+         If the helper still cannot proceed, install the latest
+         <span class="monospaced">
+          pve-manager
+         </span>
+         and retry.
+Contact Proxmox support before editing the journal or keyrings, or before using
+the upstream Cephx key migration procedure
+         <span class="footnote">
+          <br/>
+          [Ceph documentation:
+          <a href="https://docs.ceph.com/en/tentacle/rados/configuration/auth-config-ref/#cephx-upgrade">
